{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.poster.avif?t=1770798281\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.webm?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.mp4?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go North</strong> is a cozy and immersive maze adventure. With the help of numerous magical and technological items, navigate beautifully unique mazes and explore expansive worlds in a story-driven adventure like no other.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.poster.avif?t=1770798281\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.webm?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ef6e185d2b3b6606563e096233ebd87b.mp4?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/e7bb7c5a26c4ed9d2d93f0e32e9eb8eb.avif?t=1770798281\" width=500 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the Maze God resides at the northernmost part of the world and that he grants one wish to any adventurer brave and clever enough to reach him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dara begins her journey with a singular purpose: to Go North, meet the Maze God and have her undying wish granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.poster.avif?t=1770798281\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.webm?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/4cb2c7db155cee69f94b8c772a1490ec.mp4?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must navigate countless mazes and labyrinths purposefully crafted by the Maze Makers to test her perseverance. But something sinister seems to be corrupting the mazes. Something\u2026 or someone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/78c670b451127752f92f6ba566c89254.avif?t=1770798281\" width=500 height=94 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate beautiful mazes in 3rd person: walk around atmospheric and gorgeous mazes while discovering different items, characters, puzzles and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, keep and use unique and helpful items scattered around each maze ranging from simple items like a hoverboard to more elaborate items like a robot mouse that scurries towards the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and avoid obstacles: use your wits to solve the different puzzles and obstacles within each maze. decipher different riddles and clues to uncover secret passages, items and easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer:\u00a0compete online against your friends and players across the globe, cross-platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade:\u00a0explore an infinite amount of cleverly generated mazes of varying forms and worlds. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3041730?t=1770798281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3041730?t=1770798281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/f1c6d294ffb5003a48d4ac904cdd6a2a35a919fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770798281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/f1c6d294ffb5003a48d4ac904cdd6a2a35a919fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770798281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.poster.avif?t=1770798281\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.webm?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041730/extras/ddb9edb8f06668b8c2d52aa26a5ff9d3.mp4?t=1770798281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go North</strong> is a cozy and immersive maze adventure. With the help of numerous magical and technological items, n